  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>: Mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.<br />Or, for every atom of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math> we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>atoms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br />Thus, the ratio of atoms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Thus, the formula is: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub></math><br />Combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math>:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>xCO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br />Hence, the combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;requires <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> oxygen molecules.</p><p>Hence, the original molecule contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>molecules <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>atoms.<br />Or, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Empirical Formula<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p>",
